Category: IT Services

Location: Colombo Western Province Sri Lanka

We are urgently looking for a REMOTE (Senior) Devops Engineer - Blockchain Environment with Azure and AWS knowledge for an international Blockchain organization in Australia/NZ. Candidates need to be fluent in English.

Candidates need to be able to work 4-5 hours per day in the normal office hours of Australia/NZ.

The Ops team provides expert operational support to the development teams, specifically in designing, developing, deploying and maintaining our product infrastructure, tooling, and pipelines.

The Devops Engineer is responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining secure and reliable product infrastructure with support and guidance from their peers, Head of Engineering, and CSO.

Tasks and responsibilities:

• Design, build, deploy, improve and maintain secure, reliable production systems;

• Collaborate with development teams to understand product goals and create infrastructure alignment;

• Provide product infrastructure expertise to external SREs from open-source and external partners;

• Create Intellectual Property;

Profile:

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• +4 years of experience with designing, building, deploying, improving and maintaining secure, reliable production systems;

• Experience with Azure and/or AWS cloud platforms;

• Knowledge of Bash and at least one programming language of Go, Ruby, Rust, C++, Python, Javascript;

• Experience with Docker containerization and orchestration with Kubernetes;

• Experience with configuring and running CI platforms such as CircleCI, Travis;

• Experience with Infrastructure as Code (Terraform);

• Experience with monitoring systems;

• Experience with Linux/Unix System Administration and automation, and Agile and DevOps frameworks;

• Understanding of cloud concepts;

• Strong analytical skills, accuracy, and attention to detail;

• Fluent in English;

Offered:

A challenging role for an international Blockchain organization in Australia/NZ;

Indefinite, long-term contract;

Attractive salary package;

Interested:

If you have the determination for a rewarding career, please send your CV to us via or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

